self.KB_CONTENT["card:792407"]={"id":"card:792407","ty":"card","sourceId":"792407","title":"『費用申請單憑證』中的『選擇FAX/Email傳送狀態』為何？","ver":"GP4以上","topic":"申請單","keywords":["申請單","憑證","費用","狀態"],"y":"other","answer":"* 區分為Y.已傳送、N.未傳送及全部。* 尚未購買『FAX/Email處理系統』(FEP)，則此欄位需隱藏。","links":[],"pdfText":"","pdfPages":0,"pdfChars":0,"merged":[],"file":"kb-cards.jsonl"};
